      "id": "https://wan-ifra.org/?p=121727",
      "title": "Building the future now: Ukrainian regional media turn learning into action in Lviv",
      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/10/building-the-future-now-ukrainian-regional-media-turn-learning-into-action-in-lviv/",
      "published": "Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:49:42 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>Across three days of exchange surrounding the XV Media Congress in Lviv, Ukrainian media leaders explored how to sustain independent journalism during the war, create safer and more inclusive newsrooms, strengthen relationships with their communities and turn international partnerships into practical organisational change.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/10/building-the-future-now-ukrainian-regional-media-turn-learning-into-action-in-lviv/\">Building the future now: Ukrainian regional media turn learning into action in Lviv</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
      "source": "WAN-IFRA"
    },
    {
