      "title": "Publishers’ AI rights group SPUR doubles membership as The New York Times and AFP join",
      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/10/publishers-ai-rights-group-spur-doubles-membership-as-the-new-york-times-and-afp-join/",
      "published": "Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:46:54 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>The standards coalition marks its largest expansion since launch, surpassing 80 global media members.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/10/publishers-ai-rights-group-spur-doubles-membership-as-the-new-york-times-and-afp-join/\">Publishers’ AI rights group SPUR doubles membership as The New York Times and AFP join</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
